Sprint 11 — Statements

This sprint delivers the ability for a Member to extract a consolidated, official record of their financial history with the Ikimina platform, formatted as a downloadable PDF.

IKM-11.1 — GET /statements/me (Member PDF Statement)

Goal

Provide members with a bank-like statement of their account activity, building on the unified transaction ledger from Sprint 8.

Description

Implement the /statements/me endpoint. It leverages the existing TransactionRepository to fetch a timeline of the authenticated member's charges (obligations, penalties) and credits (payments), and uses the ExportService (from Sprint 10) to format the data into a professional PDF.

API Endpoint

GET /api/v1/statements/me Generates a downloadable PDF or JSON statement for the current member.

Query Parameters

StatementQueryDTO:

startDate (ISO 8601 string, optional)

endDate (ISO 8601 string, optional)

format (string, enum: ['json', 'pdf'], default: 'json')

